      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    BEER PRODUCTION FLOW                          |\n|                                                                  |\n|  MALTHOUSE              BREWHOUSE              FERMENTATION      |\n|  ---------              ---------              -----------       |\n|  Barley                 Mash Tun               Fermentation Vessel |\n|  -> Steep               (mashing)              (7-14 days)       |\n|  -> Germinate           -> Lauter Tun           -> Conditioning  |\n|  -> Kiln                (lautering)             -> Packaging     |\n|  MALT                   -> Kettle               -> BEER          |\n|                         (boiling + hops)                         |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+"
    },
